<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a formal constraint to the textual unit on which it operates. The property has domain desmos:FormalConstraint and range skos:Concept."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "constrains formal unit"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collega una costrizione formale all'unità testuale su cui opera (ad es. lettera, sillaba o parola). La proprietà ha come domain desmos:FormalConstraint e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
